    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>New technologies mean new threats:</i></strong> Viruses are now sentient and the Antiviruses of old are no longer effective. As Astro-Fox, your goal is to build the ultimate antivirus in order to erradicate the viruses from your computer before they overrun it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">RogueVirus is a grid-based game with elements from bullet-hell and roguelike genres. Dodge relentless attacks from your enemies and strike them with a wide variety of commands to delete them.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792430/extras/f5975d0acfdd2c70529b3f30f7cc9cb5.poster.avif?t=1749106455\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792430/extras/f5975d0acfdd2c70529b3f30f7cc9cb5.webm?t=1749106455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792430/extras/f5975d0acfdd2c70529b3f30f7cc9cb5.mp4?t=1749106455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Grid-based combat in real-time:</i></strong><i>\u00a0</i>The game is played on a board composed of up to 21 cells in which you have to quickly move to dodge attacks and ambush enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Dozens of unique attacks and upgrades:\u00a0</i></strong>Collect powerful commands to make your own antivirus and upgrade it using add-ons to gain new properties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Rule-breaking enemies:</i></strong>\u00a0Not all viruses are the same, some of them will completely ignore the rules of the game taking you off-guard if you're not careful!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Randomly generated levels:</strong></i> Each level is composed of multiple random sectors for you to explore in order to find items, stores or even allies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>New technologies mean new threats:</i></strong> Viruses are now sentient and the Antiviruses of old are no longer effective. As Astro-Fox, your goal is to build the ultimate antivirus in order to erradicate the viruses from your computer before they overrun it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">RogueVirus is a grid-based game with elements from bullet-hell and roguelike genres. Dodge relentless attacks from your enemies and strike them with a wide variety of commands to delete them.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792430/extras/f5975d0acfdd2c70529b3f30f7cc9cb5.poster.avif?t=1749106455\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792430/extras/f5975d0acfdd2c70529b3f30f7cc9cb5.webm?t=1749106455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792430/extras/f5975d0acfdd2c70529b3f30f7cc9cb5.mp4?t=1749106455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Grid-based combat in real-time:</i></strong><i>\u00a0</i>The game is played on a board composed of up to 21 cells in which you have to quickly move to dodge attacks and ambush enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Dozens of unique attacks and upgrades:\u00a0</i></strong>Collect powerful commands to make your own antivirus and upgrade it using add-ons to gain new properties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Rule-breaking enemies:</i></strong>\u00a0Not all viruses are the same, some of them will completely ignore the rules of the game taking you off-guard if you're not careful!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Randomly generated levels:</strong></i> Each level is composed of multiple random sectors for you to explore in order to find items, stores or even allies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
